# Lockfiles, Prisma schema, and migrations are intentionally NOT ignored.
# backend/pnpm-lock.yaml and frontend/pnpm-lock.yaml must be committed.
# backend/prisma/schema.prisma and backend/prisma/migrations/ must be committed
# so migrations are versioned and reproducible (SRS §17.4, DL-04).
